[PrintTextModified Text:我正带着一脸不高兴的诺亚前往二楼。|#0202Adv14_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; スマホ通知音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_29 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:刚上到楼梯尽头，<br>手机突然响了起来。|#0202Adv14_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（已经过了和艾玛约定的时间……<br>　是她在催我……？）|#0202Adv14_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我拿起手机瞟了一眼。|#0202Adv14_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:屏幕上显示着<br>【可可正在直播！】几个字。|#0202Adv14_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我叹了口气，收起手机，<br>与此同时，一个开朗的声音响起。|#0202Adv14_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:咦？<br>希罗你怎么了？|#0202Adv14_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……是诺亚。|#0202Adv14_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯——？|#0202Adv14_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚仔细盯着诺亚气鼓鼓的脸蛋。|#0202Adv14_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:……哈哈我懂了。<br>是不是被希罗教训了呀。<br>诺亚干了什么坏事吧～？|#0202Adv14_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚才没干坏事呢。|#0202Adv14_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊～。也是哦～。|#0202Adv14_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:那诺亚你到底做了什么呀？<br>|#0202Adv14_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:…………画画。|#0202Adv14_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:……她在墙壁上涂鸦。|#0202Adv14_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～原来是这样。<br>然后被希罗发现了是吧。|#0202Adv14_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:这可不好呀～诺亚。|#0202Adv14_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……诺亚会被惩罚？|#0202Adv14_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，是啊。<br>可能会狠狠惩罚你哦。|#0202Adv14_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:什么……！？|#0202Adv14_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:……你们把我当成什么人了。|#0202Adv14_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:开玩笑啦开玩笑！<br>希罗才不会做那种事。|#0202Adv14_Miria009| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……不过她可能会口头教育你一下。|#0202Adv14_Miria010| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:唔～|#0202Adv14_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯～……|#0202Adv14_Miria011| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚抱起胳膊，<br>稍作思考后开口说道。|#0202Adv14_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:……那诺亚要不要和大叔我一起看电影呀？<br>|#0202Adv14_Miria012| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:……电影？|#0202Adv14_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。<br>是个在街头墙壁上涂鸦的<br>街头艺术家的故事。|#0202Adv14_Miria013| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……感觉很无聊。|#0202Adv14_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:那你想被希罗教训？|#0202Adv14_Miria014| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……诺亚要看电影。|#0202Adv14_Noah008| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:好嘞，那我们就去看电影吧。<br>大叔我会给你解说的。|#0202Adv14_Miria015| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚说完便牵起诺亚的手。|#0202Adv14_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:然后朝我眨了眨眼。|#0202Adv14_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（……太感谢了）|#0202Adv14_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:终于把诺亚塞给米莉亚，我松了口气。|#0202Adv14_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（再不去汇合<br>　艾玛搞不好就要回去了）|#0202Adv14_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; スマホ通知音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_29 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:刚准备下楼梯，<br>手机铃声又开始震动并响了起来。|#0202Adv14_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……又来了）|#0202Adv14_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不耐烦地停下脚步，<br>打开手机一看。|#0202Adv14_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:果不其然还是可可的名字。|#0202Adv14_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我决定无视，正打算把手机收起来，<br>这时我突然想到。|#0202Adv14_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……她该不会在淋浴房直播吧……？）|#0202Adv14_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一阵不祥的预感袭上心头，<br>谨慎起见我点开了直播页面。|#0202Adv14_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

