; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0202Adv14_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_21_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:（怎么回事？好像不太对劲）|#0202Adv14_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:屏幕上可可的表情<br>让我感觉有几分怪异。|#0202Adv14_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的视线正在快速地到处游走。<br>又像是焦急，又像是在恐惧着什么东西。|#0202Adv14_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0202Adv14_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明已经开始直播了，<br>可可却一言不发。|#0202Adv14_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，糟糕……！|#0202Adv14_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1
@Wait WaitMode:1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:大家好啊，我是可可碳～！|#0202Adv14_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:过了一会，<br>可可开始说话救场。|#0202Adv14_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，今天……|#0202Adv14_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:那个……啥来着……|#0202Adv14_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:对、对了！闲聊！<br>今天来开闲聊台吧～……！|#0202Adv14_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……这举止明显很可疑）|#0202Adv14_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不仅如此，不祥的预感应验了。<br>可可身后是那幅熟悉的画。|#0202Adv14_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（淋浴房……！）|#0202Adv14_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在可可就在淋浴房直播。|#0202Adv14_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啧……又有人来碍事……！|#0202Adv14_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（现在淋浴房里有艾玛和可可两个人）|#0202Adv14_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果现在过去，毫无疑问会被人看到<br>　我和艾玛在一起的场面……）|#0202Adv14_Hiro014|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这样肯定会被怀疑……<br>　虽然很不甘心，但这次只能放弃实施……）|#0202Adv14_Hiro015|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:……啊！！|#0202Adv14_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可惊讶的声音，<br>让我正准备关闭直播的手不由得停了下来。|#0202Adv14_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:喂，听得到吗～！<br>……欸？|#0202Adv14_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可向屏幕另一端观众问话的声音<br>突然停住了。|#0202Adv14_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:不是……等|#0202Adv14_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; 銃声
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_38 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#550000FF Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:什么！？|#0202Adv14_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:伴随着类似枪响的声音，<br>黑红的飞沫弄脏了整个画面。|#0202Adv14_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

