[PrintTextModified Text:紧接着，<br>直播就中断了，画面一片漆黑。|#0202Adv14_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_21_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:虽说是手机屏幕上的画面，<br>但这冲击性的场面还是让我的心跳急剧加速。|#0202Adv14_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:拿着手机的手也开始发抖。|#0202Adv14_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（枪声……？<br>　发生什么事了……？）|#0202Adv14_Hiro017|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……不对，想都不用想）|#0202Adv14_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在画面的另一端，<br>可可被什么人枪击了。|#0202Adv14_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（在淋浴房……发生了凶杀案……<br>　那凶手就是……）|#0202Adv14_Hiro019|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的面庞愈发清晰地浮现在我的脑海中。|#0202Adv14_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……艾玛！|#0202Adv14_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我大喊她的名字，<br>奔向淋浴房。|#0202Adv14_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——然而。|#0202Adv14_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised

; どんっと人がぶつかる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_27 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@SpawnShake ActorId:Camera

[PrintTextModified Text:呀啊啊！？|#0202Adv14_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呃唔！？|#0202Adv14_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:下楼的时候我突然撞到了人，<br>虽然没摔下楼，<br>但也被撞得一屁股坐到了地上。|#0202Adv14_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0202Adv14_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:到底在搞什么呀！！|#0202Adv14_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看向声音的方向，<br>原来我撞到的人是汉娜。|#0202Adv14_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在往下几级台阶处，汉娜也跟我一样，一屁股跌坐在了地上。<br>她身旁是散落一地的衣服。|#0202Adv14_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:我看下雨了，赶紧把衣服收进来……<br>这下又得重洗了！|#0202Adv14_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（下雨……？我都没注意到。<br>　看来这些衣服是她洗过的）|#0202Adv14_Hiro023|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我站起身，<br>把那些几乎干掉的衣服拿开，<br>从汉娜身边走过。|#0202Adv14_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……不好意思，我有急事先走了。|#0202Adv14_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry

[PrintTextModified Text:等等！<br>是你先撞上我的，<br>你倒是帮帮忙啊！|#0202Adv14_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她从身后抓住我的手，<br>可我现在真的无暇在意这些。|#0202Adv14_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; 手を払う音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_18 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我心里有些歉意，<br>但还是果断地甩开了汉娜的手。<br>然后立即奔跑起来。|#0202Adv14_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

