@Wait WaitMode:0.6

[PrintTextModified Text:真是的……！<br>又是突降暴雨又是交通事故，我也太倒霉了吧！？|#0202Adv14_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

